cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Melaya: Visual builder for high-trust AI agents, with Device Control as the flagship"
message: "If you reference Melaya, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Antoine
    family-names: Roche
    affiliation: Melaya
abstract: >-
  Melaya is a visual builder for high-trust AI agents. Its flagship is Device
  Control: the AI you already pay for (Claude, GPT, Gemini, or a local model)
  operating your real phone apps, no app API required, with human approval on
  every sensitive action. The platform provides scoped tools, explicit
  permissions, secure connectors, per-workflow RAG, cost tracking, audit logs,
  and human-in-the-loop approval. SDKs cover three planes: melaya.agents.*,
  melaya.platform.*, and melaya.trading.* (trading via Melaya Labs, coming
  later).
url: "https://melaya.org"
